# JavaScript (CaaS Control)

## Runtime entry

- **`public/js/caas-control-chaos.js`** — single shared runtime for companion UI and chaos features. Expects `window.caasControlChaos` from PHP (`wp_localize_script`). Exit early if config is missing; guard with `window.__caasControlChaosInit` so the script initializes once.
- **`admin/js/caas-control-admin.js`** — CaaS settings screens, user profile (`profile` / `user-edit` when CaaS is enabled). Always binds `.caas-control-tip__trigger` tooltips; maintenance AJAX, pro stub, and media picker require `window.caasControlAdmin` (settings pages only).
- **`admin/js/caas-control-editor.js`** — block editor extensions; registered on `enqueue_block_editor_assets` when backend chaos is enabled.

Do not add a second global chaos bootstrap; extend `caas-control-chaos.js` or the editor script.

## Config shape

PHP builds config via `Caas_Control_Settings::chaos_config_for_js()` (camelCase keys: `agent`, `customImageUrl`, `catImageUrl`, `meowSoundUrl`, `judgingVideoUrl`, `companionName`, `appearAfterSeconds`, `frequencyMinutes`, `durationSeconds`, `behaviors.*`, `features.*`, `strings`, `i18n`, `proEnabled`). Agents in JS: `cat` uses `catImageUrl`; `custom` uses `customImageUrl` when set (`creatureMediaUrl()` → `normalizeMediaUrl()`). URLs ending in `.mp4`/`.webm`/`.ogg` render as muted looping `<video>` via `appendAgentMedia()` (`attemptVideoPlay()`, including on `loadeddata`); creature-size media is decorative (`aria-hidden`, empty alt). Otherwise `<img>` or emoji fallback.

`behaviors.*` maps PHP `behavior_*` keys to camelCase (`blockMouse`, `randomBlock`, etc.). `features.*` mirrors `enable_*` toggles: `publishGate`, `idleJudgment`, `keyboardTrample`, `redDot`, `fakeSecurity`, `footerPeekaboo`, `pawTrail`, `scrollPost`, `wooCartWiggle`. `appearAfterSeconds` drives `chaosIntervalMs()` for first and repeat timed chaos; `frequencyMinutes` is fallback only when `appearAfterSeconds` is undefined/null. `durationSeconds` is 5–600 (step 5 from PHP). Notable `strings`: `judgingYou`, `idleJudgment`, `publishGate`, `scrollPost`, `shoo`, `shooDismissed`, `countdownMinsOnly`, `countdownMinsSeconds`, `countdownSeconds`. Admin/front merges extra keys:

| Key | Typical values |
|-----|------------------|
| `context` | `frontend`, `backend`, `block-editor`, `login`, `woo_thankyou` |
| `isAdmin` | boolean |
| `sidekick` | user meta slug (admin only) |
| `loginFailed` | true on failed login when login hiss is on |
| `previewHarness` | true on CaaS settings pages: `init()` syncs the admin form then exits (no scheduler, no live feature hooks); preview clicks handled in chaos via `bindSettingsPreviewButtons()` |

User-visible copy belongs in PHP `strings` / `i18n` inside `chaos_config_for_js()`, not hard-coded English in JS.

## Meow and audio

- `behavior_meow` maps to `cfg.behaviors.meow`. When on, `meow()` plays bundled `meowSoundUrl` + toast—used for **direct actions** (publish gate, failed login hiss), not for timed walk/sit/follow/block behaviors.
- Scroll-to-top scratching post calls `playMeowSound()` on click and uses `cfg.strings.scrollPost`.

## Sit and judging

- `sitJudgingMediaUrl()` uses `cfg.judgingVideoUrl`, else falls back to `creatureMediaUrl()` (custom/cat sprite).
- `behaviorSit()` centers the companion (`.caas-control-creature--sit`), then `playSitJudgingVideo()` builds `.caas-control-judging-media` with countdown (`.caas-control-judging-countdown`, `role="timer"`), **Shoo!** (`.caas-control-shoo-btn` → `shooAwayJudging()`), and media via `appendAgentMedia(..., 'judging')` (video does not loop). Wrap fades in with `.is-visible` (pointer-events enabled while visible/fading); teardown adds `.is-fading-out` and uses opacity transition unless `removeSitMedia(true)`.
- End timing: `chaosDurationMs()` from `durationSeconds`; video sit uses `bindSitEndToChaosDuration()` (unloops, pauses at end); image/other uses timeout + `startSitCountdown()`. Publish gate calls `behaviorSit({ skipAutoTimer: true })` then `resumePublish(chaosDurationMs())` with countdown on the judging wrap.
- `paintCreatureMedia()` refreshes creature DOM when agent/media changes; `ensureCreature()` sets aria-label each time.
- Falls back to `strings.judgingYou` toast when no media URL exists.
- Publish gate and idle judgment reuse sit/judging; random scheduler skips new antics while sit judgment is active (`isSitJudgmentActive()`).

## Behavior & feature preview (admin)

- Global Menace: Pawdructivity has one `.caas-control-behavior-preview` (walk). **Chaos Actions** / **Visitor features** use `.caas-control-feature-preview` with `data-caas-feature`. Delegated clicks (chaos `bindSettingsPreviewButtons()`, only when `previewHarness` + `context === 'backend'`) call `syncConfigFromAdminForm()` then `window.caasControlPreviewBehavior(slug)` or `window.caasControlPreviewFeature(slug)`. Each preview run starts with `resetPreviewState()` (clears prior preview DOM/timers/creature).
- Behavior slugs: `walk`, `sit`, `follow`, `blockMouse`, `randomBlock`, `meow` (direct meow + toast). Feature slugs: `guilt404`, `publishGate`, `idleJudgment`, `loginHiss`, `keyboardTrample`, `redDot`, `fakeSecurity`, `footerPeekaboo`, `pawTrail`, `scrollPost`, `wooCartWiggle`. Preview-only UI classes include `.caas-control-preview-woo-cart`, reused live classes (`.caas-control-404-guilt`, `.caas-control-red-dot`, scroll-post wrap, etc.).
- `syncChaosConfigFromForm()` (admin JS) updates live `durationSeconds`, `appearAfterSeconds`, agent/media, and mirrors checked `enable_*` fields into `cfg.features.*`; exposed as `window.__caasControlSyncChaosFromForm` on load. Backend preview harness waits up to ~2s for that function before `init()` completes.
- Requires chaos on the settings screen (`previewHarness: true`). On failure, alert `caasControlAdmin.i18n.previewUnavailable`.

## Chaos UI hooks

| Feature | DOM / classes |
|---------|----------------|
| Paw trail | `.caas-control-paw`, CSS var `--caas-paw-rot` |
| Scroll post | `.caas-control-scroll-post-wrap`, `.caas-control-scroll-post`, `.caas-control-scratch-flake`, `.caas-control-scroll-post-cat`; wrap gets `.is-visible` after scroll threshold; button `.is-scratching` during smooth scroll-to-top |
| Companion | `.caas-control-creature`, modifiers `--walk`, `--sit`, `--follow`, `--hiss` |
| Sit judging | `.caas-control-judging-media` (`.is-visible`), `.caas-control-judging-countdown`, `.caas-control-shoo-btn` |
| Toasts / blocks | `.caas-control-toast`, `.caas-control-mouse-block`, `.caas-control-screen-block` |

Custom agent fields on Global Menace: `.caas-control-custom-agent-fields` toggled via `syncCustomAgentFields()` when agent radio is `custom` (scoped under `.caas-control-form`). Range sliders share `.caas-control-duration-slider` styling: chaos duration `input.caas-control-duration-range` (`syncDurationSliderUi()` / `chaosDurationSliderLabel`, max → `durationUntilYourCry`); appear-after `input.caas-control-appear-after-range` (`syncAppearAfterSliderUi()` / `appearAfterSliderLabel`, hours template when minutes &gt; `appearAfterHourLabelAboveMinutes`). Labels update `.caas-control-duration-value__num` / `__suffix` and range `aria-valuetext` via `caasControlAdmin.i18n` (`durationMinsOnly`, `durationMinsSeconds`, `durationSeconds`, etc.). Form `data-caas-cat-media-url` / `data-caas-judging-media-url` feed preview config. Media upload `.caas-control-upload-image` requires `wp.media` (only enqueued on settings screens); otherwise alert `caasControlAdmin.i18n.mediaMissing`.

## Admin settings UI

- Tooltips: delegated click on `.caas-control-tip__trigger` toggles `.is-open` on `.caas-control-tip`; document click closes all. Runs even when `caasControlAdmin` is absent (profile screens).
- Maintenance / pro buttons and `ajaxAction()` require `caasControlAdmin` (early return after tooltip + agent wiring if missing).

## Admin AJAX

Maintenance buttons use jQuery `$.post` to `admin-ajax.php` with actions `caas_control_scoop_revisions` and `caas_control_clear_cache`, nonce key `nonce`, value from `caasControlAdmin.nonce` (`caas_control_maintenance`).

## Style

- IIFE wrappers, `'use strict'`.
- Match existing ES5-style in chaos.js (no build step); block editor script may use `wp.*` packages as dependencies.
- Prefer CSS classes prefixed with `caas-control-` for DOM hooks and styling.
